This directory holds Bootstrap's prebuilt JS bundle, vendored verbatim.
Do not hand-edit it.

  version: Bootstrap 5.3.3
  source:  node_modules/bootstrap/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js
           from `npm install bootstrap@<version>`

The site uses two of its components: collapse (navbar) and dropdown (MFC cite
menu). The .map file is deliberately not vendored.
